:li xml:lang="x-default">© David Osipov. All rights reserved.</rdf:li></rdf:Alt></dc:rights><dc:description><rdf:Alt><rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Single-ink horizontal NevroTick logo combining an optical head mark with exact outlined lettering, in dark ink. Prepared for light surfaces; the surrounding canvas is transparent. Created in an AI-assisted code and design workflow from existing vector geometry or outlined typography; author: David Osipov. Derived from the reviewed NevroTick raster kit v1.1. Proprietary NevroTick brand artwork; the application source code is licensed separately as open source.</rdf:li></rdf:Alt></dc:description><Iptc4xmpCore:IntellectualGenre>Logo</Iptc4xmpCore:IntellectualGenre><Iptc4xmpCore:CreatorContactInfo rdf:parseType="Resource"><Iptc4xmpCore:CiAdrCtry>Georgia</Iptc4xmpCore:CiAdrCtry><Iptc4xmpCore:CiAdrCity>Tbilisi</Iptc4xmpCore:CiAdrCity><Iptc4xmpCore:CiEmailWork>business@david-osipov.vision</Iptc4xmpCore:CiEmailWork><Iptc4xmpCore:CiUrlWork>https://david-osipov.vision</Iptc4xmpCore:CiUrlWork></Iptc4xmpCore:CreatorContactInfo><Iptc4xmpCore:AltTextAccessibility><rdf:Alt><rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">A simplified mascot head beside the word NevroTick, both in a single dark color. Transparent surrounding canvas.</rdf:li></rdf:Alt></Iptc4xmpCore:AltTextAccessibility><xmpMM:InstanceID>xmp.iid:1ed64870-137b-43d9-8a98-9e0bfc0f1c24</xmpMM:InstanceID><xmpMM:DocumentID>xmp.did:90c24ea8-e745-4310-a93c-e7b056508037</xmpMM:DocumentID><xmpMM:History><rdf:Seq><rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource"><stEvt:action>saved</stEvt:action><stEvt:instanceID>xmp.iid:1ed64870-137b-43d9-8a98-9e0bfc0f1c24</stEvt:instanceID><stEvt:when>2026-10-28T19:58:38+00:00</stEvt:when><stEvt:softwareAgent>NevroTick AVIF metadata workflow</stEvt:softwareAgent></rdf:li></rdf:Seq></xmpMM:History><xmpRights:Marked>True</xmpRights:Marked><xmpRights:Owner><rdf:Bag><rdf:li>David Osipov</rdf:li></rdf:Bag></xmpRights:Owner><xmpRights:UsageTerms><rdf:Alt><rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Proprie